{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50926","headline":"喜晴 · 吕从庆","name":"喜晴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瞳瞳云间日，兼旬不得明。\n一朝雨势歇，衆鸟喧新晴。\n南窗有老叟，喜极推枯枰。\n呼僮载樽酒，访渠泉石盟。\n出门有佳趣，清风生绿萍。\n笑语途中泥，尔难濡我情。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}